{"segments": [{"start": 0.0, "end": 3.54, "text": "In this town, the richer you are, the higher your house is."}, {"start": 3.86, "end": 5.58, "text": "I used to live next to a garbage dump,"}, {"start": 5.84, "end": 8.12, "text": "until a golden mansion fell from the sky,"}, {"start": 8.34, "end": 10.58, "text": "and a mysterious key made me its new owner."}, {"start": 10.96, "end": 13.54, "text": "And now, every billionaire mansion in the sky"}, {"start": 13.54, "end": 15.24, "text": "is moving straight toward me."}, {"start": 15.62, "end": 16.3, "text": "You're getting closer."}, {"start": 17.1, "end": 19.62, "text": "Suddenly, the golden key in my hand starts glowing."}, {"start": 20.04, "end": 22.22, "text": "A secret elevator rises from the ground."}, {"start": 22.62, "end": 24.9, "text": "I jump inside, and before I can press a button,"}, {"start": 25.18, "end": 26.4, "text": "it shoots into the sky."}, {"start": 26.4, "end": 28.78, "text": "I fly past the middle-class towers,"}, {"start": 29.08, "end": 31.76, "text": "rooftop pools, and my rich friend's pet dinosaur."}, {"start": 32.5, "end": 36.24, "text": "Floor 500, floor 1,000, floor 10,000."}, {"start": 36.5, "end": 39.74, "text": "I'm above the clouds, but the elevator keeps going,"}, {"start": 40.0, "end": 43.84, "text": "until I reach a gigantic golden castle floating in space."}, {"start": 44.4, "end": 46.82, "text": "Inside, the richest billionaire in the world"}, {"start": 46.82, "end": 47.82, "text": "is waiting for me."}, {"start": 48.08, "end": 50.92, "text": "The moment he sees my key, his face turns pale."}, {"start": 51.36, "end": 53.12, "text": "That key was supposed to be destroyed!"}, {"start": 53.76, "end": 56.06, "text": "Behind him, I discover a massive machine"}, {"start": 56.06, "end": 57.64, "text": "covered in glowing buttons."}, {"start": 58.06, "end": 60.22, "text": "Every button controls a house in my town,"}, {"start": 60.58, "end": 62.32, "text": "and that's when I realize the truth."}, {"start": 62.74, "end": 65.26, "text": "The billionaires have been controlling the entire city."}, {"start": 65.7, "end": 67.42, "text": "They decide who lives above the clouds"}, {"start": 67.42, "end": 69.56, "text": "and who stays down next to the garbage."}, {"start": 70.18, "end": 72.06, "text": "The previous owner discovered their secret."}, {"start": 72.38, "end": 73.82, "text": "He tried to shut the machine down,"}, {"start": 74.08, "end": 76.84, "text": "so the billionaires pushed his mansion out of the sky,"}, {"start": 77.06, "end": 78.96, "text": "and now, they're coming for me."}, {"start": 79.38, "end": 82.12, "text": "The billionaire lunges at me, trying to grab my key."}, {"start": 82.12, "end": 84.4, "text": "I dodge him, sprint across the room,"}, {"start": 84.62, "end": 86.2, "text": "and slam the key into the machine."}, {"start": 86.82, "end": 88.72, "text": "A giant red button lights up."}, {"start": 89.1, "end": 90.08, "text": "Reset the city."}, {"start": 90.52, "end": 91.2, "text": "I press it."}, {"start": 91.52, "end": 93.34, "text": "The entire castle starts shaking."}, {"start": 93.82, "end": 95.8, "text": "Thousands of houses begin moving at once."}, {"start": 96.3, "end": 98.26, "text": "Tiny wooden shacks rise from the ground."}, {"start": 98.76, "end": 101.28, "text": "Giant billionaire mansions descend from the clouds,"}, {"start": 101.54, "end": 104.4, "text": "and suddenly, every family has a beautiful home"}, {"start": 104.4, "end": 105.28, "text": "at the same height."}, {"start": 105.78, "end": 107.58, "text": "Nobody lives above anyone else anymore."}, {"start": 108.02, "end": 110.6, "text": "For the first time, everyone is equal."}, {"start": 110.6, "end": 113.28, "text": "But then, something unexpected happens."}, {"start": 113.7, "end": 115.92, "text": "The billionaire's golden castle vanishes."}, {"start": 116.44, "end": 118.24, "text": "I hear someone screaming far below."}, {"start": 118.72, "end": 120.78, "text": "I look down, and there he is,"}, {"start": 121.12, "end": 122.58, "text": "the richest man in the world,"}, {"start": 122.92, "end": 125.02, "text": "sitting inside my old wooden shack,"}, {"start": 125.38, "end": 126.86, "text": "right next to the garbage dump."}, {"start": 127.34, "end": 128.44, "text": "I can't help but smile."}, {"start": 129.0, "end": 130.06, "text": "Welcome to the ground floor."}], "words": [{"w": "In", "s": 0.0, "e": 0.2}, {"w": "this", "s": 0.2, "e": 0.4}, {"w": "town,", "s": 0.4, "e": 0.72}, {"w": "the", "s": 1.06, "e": 1.14}, {"w": "richer", "s": 1.14, "e": 1.38}, {"w": "you", "s": 1.38, "e": 1.62}, {"w": "are,", "s": 1.62, "e": 1.94}, {"w": "the", "s": 2.16, "e": 2.24}, {"w": "higher", "s": 2.24, "e": 2.62}, {"w": "your", "s": 2.62, "e": 2.88}, {"w": "house", "s": 2.88, "e": 3.1}, {"w": "is.", "s": 3.1, "e": 3.54}, {"w": "I", "s": 3.86, "e": 3.98}, {"w": "used", "s": 3.98, "e": 4.08}, {"w": "to", "s": 4.08, "e": 4.24}, {"w": "live", "s": 4.24, "e": 4.38}, {"w": "next", "s": 4.38, "e": 4.56}, {"w": "to", "s": 4.56, "e": 4.72}, {"w": "a", "s": 4.72, "e": 4.88}, {"w": "garbage", "s": 4.88, "e": 5.22}, {"w": "dump,", "s": 5.22, "e": 5.58}, {"w": "until", "s": 5.84, "e": 6.1}, {"w": "a", "s": 6.1, "e": 6.3}, {"w": "golden", "s": 6.3, "e": 6.6}, {"w": "mansion", "s": 6.6, "e": 7.08}, {"w": "fell", "s": 7.08, "e": 7.42}, {"w": "from", "s": 7.42, "e": 7.66}, {"w": "the", "s": 7.66, "e": 7.8}, {"w": "sky,", "s": 7.8, "e": 8.12}, {"w": "and", "s": 8.34, "e": 8.42}, {"w": "a", "s": 8.42, "e": 8.52}, {"w": "mysterious", "s": 8.52, "e": 9.04}, {"w": "key", "s": 9.04, "e": 9.46}, {"w": "made", "s": 9.46, "e": 9.74}, {"w": "me", "s": 9.74, "e": 9.94}, {"w": "its", "s": 9.94, "e": 10.06}, {"w": "new", "s": 10.06, "e": 10.26}, {"w": "owner.", "s": 10.26, "e": 10.58}, {"w": "And", "s": 10.96, "e": 11.08}, {"w": "now,", "s": 11.08, "e": 11.4}, {"w": "every", "s": 11.66, "e": 12.04}, {"w": "billionaire", "s": 12.04, "e": 12.54}, {"w": "mansion", "s": 